<title>USA: Shoney's Q4 same-store sales up 0.3 pct.</title>
<headline>Shoney's Q4 same-store sales up 0.3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>NASHVILLE, Tenn. 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shoney's Inc on Wednesday said comparable store sales in its Shoney's Restaurants increased 0.3 percent for the fourth quarter after menu prices were increased.</p>
<p>The firm said overall same-store sales increased 0.5 percent for the fourth quarter and increased 0.2 for fiscal 1996. The sales results included menu price increases of 2.9 percent and 2.0 percent, respectively, for the fourth quarter and year.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk +1 212 859 1610</p>
</text>
